<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:50:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>裕信银行扫清了接管德国商业银行的最后障碍</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/unicredit-clears-final-hurdle-to-take-over-commerzbank-video-mwxge90q</link><description>裕信银行提议首席执行官安德里亚·奥塞尔（Andrea Orcel）担任德国商业银行董事长，这家意大利银行正在采取行动，以控制其德国竞争对手，这是欧洲几十年来最大的银行业交易之一。彭博社的史蒂文·阿伦斯报道。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/unicredit-clears-final-hurdle-to-take-over-commerzbank-video-mwxge90q'&gt;裕信银行扫清了接管德国商业银行的最后障碍&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：UniCredit Clears Final Hurdle to Take Over Commerzbank&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-26/unicredit-clears-final-hurdle-to-take-over-commerzbank-video-mwxge90q</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:12:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>马来西亚称如果亚航财务困境恶化可能会进行干预</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/malaysia-says-may-intervene-if-airasia-s-financial-woes-worsen</link><description>第二财政部长阿米尔·哈姆扎·阿齐赞表示，如果亚洲航空集团有限公司的财务困难恶化，马来西亚可能会考虑介入支持该公司，因为政府寻求保护国内航空连通性。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/malaysia-says-may-intervene-if-airasia-s-financial-woes-worsen'&gt;马来西亚称如果亚航财务困境恶化可能会进行干预&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Malaysia Says May Intervene If AirAsia’s Financial Woes Worsen&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/malaysia-says-may-intervene-if-airasia-s-financial-woes-worsen</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:22:52 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Global Stocks Climb as AI Trade Mounts a Comeback: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>AlexForbes 资产达到 450 亿美元后出现更多增长</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/alexforbes-sees-more-growth-after-assets-hit-45-billion</link><description>南非最大的商业退休基金管理机构上半年管理资产增加了 13%，预计今年剩余时间将保持这一速度。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/alexforbes-sees-more-growth-after-assets-hit-45-billion'&gt;AlexForbes 资产达到 450 亿美元后出现更多增长&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：AlexForbes Sees More Growth After Assets Hit $45 Billion&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/alexforbes-sees-more-growth-after-assets-hit-45-billion</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:28:44 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于波动性打击金属，铜价从今年最低点反弹</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals</link><description>尽管人们对人工智能繁荣和相关工业金属需求的持久性仍存疑虑，但铜价从 11 个月低点上涨逾 3%，追随科技股的涨幅。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals'&gt;由于波动性打击金属，铜价从今年最低点反弹&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Copper Rebounds From Lowest This Year as Volatility Grips Metals&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/copper-rebounds-from-lowest-this-year-as-volatility-hits-metals</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:01:10 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>